Package: vapvAgronomyManagementStudy
Title: Vertical Agrivoltaics Study 2 -- Agronomic Management Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Magnus Kamau Katana", "Lindhardt", email = "kamaulindhardt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A targets-framework reproducible pipeline for Study 2 (agronomic
    management -- fertilisation x crop-residue treatments) of the Value4Farm
    vertical agrivoltaics PhD project at Aarhus University, Foulum. Not a
    distributable R package; this DESCRIPTION exists solely to drive renv's
    explicit dependency snapshot (see renv::settings$snapshot.type()).
